{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48226","headline":"乞金鱼词 · 崔日用","name":"乞金鱼词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"台中鼠子直须谙，信足跳梁上壁龛。\n倚飜灯脂汚张五，还来啮带报韩三。\n莫浪语，直王相，大家必若赐金龟，卖却猫儿相报赏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔日用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48226.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48226","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}